      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Brownian. Randomness as the visual language: a full-bleed fan of real simulated paths, the Monte Carlo check up front.\n\nLayout: Full-bleed hero chart with an overlaid title box, then asymmetric 5/7 spreads that swap sides.\nThe memorable thing: The home page is 60 simulated one-year paths from the project's own simulator, with the headline laid over them.\nType: Syne 700–800 for headlines and figures; Work Sans 400–700 for text, tables and charts.\nLight: bg #FFFFFF, surf #F6F4F7, ink #121212, muted #5D5761, acc #B8166F, line #D6D0DA\nDark: bg #0D0B14, surf #16131F, ink #EDEBF5, muted #9690AA, acc #FF5CB8, line #2E2940\nMagnet rail on the right edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
